{title: 246 - Worthy, Worthy Is the Lamb}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #246 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 246}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Worthy, [Dm]worthy [F]is the [G]Lamb, [Am]Worthy, [F]worthy [G7]is [Am]the [F]Lamb,
[Em]Worthy, [C]worthy [Dm]is [C/E]the [F]Lamb, [G]That [Am]was [C]slain.
[F]Glory, hallelujah! [G7]Praise [C]Him, hallelujah!
[F/C]Glory, [C]hallelujah! [Dm]To the [G]Lamb!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Em]Glory, hallelujah!
[C]Praise Him, hallelujah!
[F]Glory, hallelujah!
[C]To the Lamb!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Savior, [F]let [G]Thy [C]kingdom [Am]come!
[Em]Now [Dm]the [C]power of [F]sin [G]consume;
[F]Bring Thy [G]blest [G7]millennium,
[F/C]Holy [Dm]Lamb.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Thus [F]may we
[Em]each [C]moment [G]feel,
[Em]Love [C]Him, serve [G]Him,
[F]praise [G]Him [C]still,
[F]Till we [G]all [G7]on [C]Zion's hill
[F/C]See the [Dm]Lamb.
{end_of_verse}
